      "description": "Customer or account number at the dealer after Cust #, Customer No., Customer ID, Account #, Acct No., and a customer code alone on its line, as printed under SOLD TO (KETC03, PELK04; read PELKO 4 by a scan).",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "regex": "(?:(?=[A-Za-z0-9&'’#])(?<=[ \\t:])(?<=(?:[Oo]|[Nn]\\.?|:)[ \\t]{0,5})(?<=(?<![A-Za-z0-9])(?:(?:(?:SOLD|BILL|SHIP|INVOICE)[ \\t]?-?[ \\t]?TO|ATTN\\.?|ATTENTION)[ \\t]{0,2}:?|(?:DELIVER(?:ED)?[ \\t]TO|OWNER|LESSEE|CUSTOMER(?:[ \\t]NAME)?|BUYER|PURCHASER|CONSIGNEE|CONTACT|SITE[ \\t]CONTACT|PRINT(?:ED)?[ \\t]NAME|NAME[ \\t]\\(PRINT(?:ED)?\\)|ACCEPTED[ \\t]BY(?:[ \\t]\\(CUSTOMER\\))?|RECEIVED[ \\t]BY|SIGNED[ \\t]BY)[ \\t]{0,2}:)[ \\t]{0,3})(?!(?:(?:SOLD|SHIP|BILL)[ \\t]?TO|PH(?:ONE)?|TEL|CELL|MOBILE|FAX|E-?MAIL|DATE|P\\.?O\\.?|TERMS|CUST(?:OMER)?[ \\t]?(?:#|NO)|TAX|ACCT|TITLE)(?![A-Za-z])|[^ \\t\\n:]{1,25}[ \\t]?:)(?!(?:SAME|WILL[ \\t]CALL|PICK[ \\t]?-?UP|CUSTOMER[ \\t]PICK|N/A|NONE)(?![A-Za-z]))[A-Za-z0-9&'’#][A-Za-z0-9&'’#.\\-/()]{0,30}(?:(?:,?[ \\t]{1,2}|[ \\t]{1,2}[\\-–][ \\t]{1,2})(?!(?:(?:SOLD|SHIP|BILL)[ \\t]?TO|PH(?:ONE)?|TEL|CELL|MOBILE|FAX|E-?MAIL|DATE|P\\.?O\\.?|TERMS|CUST(?:OMER)?[ \\t]?(?:#|NO)|TAX|ACCT|TITLE)(?![A-Za-z])|[^ \\t\\n:]{1,25}[ \\t]?:)[A-Za-z0-9&'’#][A-Za-z0-9&'’#.\\-/()]{0,30}){0,14})|(?m:(?<=(?<![^\\n])[ \\t]{0,6})(?=[A-Za-z0-9&'’])(?![^\\n]{0,100}(?<![A-Za-z])(?:EQUIPMENT|EQUIP|TRACTORS?|IMPLEMENTS?|MACHINERY|MOTORS|SALES|SUPPLY|SUPPLIES|RENTALS?|DEALERS?(?:HIP)?|TURF|POWER|PARTS|FINANCE|FINANCIAL|BANK|CREDIT|CAPITAL|LEASING|INSURANCE|AUCTIONS?|AUCTIONEERS|INVOICE|QUOTATION|SPECIMEN|THANK)(?![A-Za-z]))(?:[A-Za-z0-9&'’][A-Za-z0-9&'’.\\-]{0,25}(?:[ \\t]{1,2}|,[ \\t]?)){0,5}(?:(?:LOGGING|TIMBER|TIMBERLANDS|FORESTRY|FOREST[ \\t]PRODUCTS|EXCAVATING|EXCAVATION|GRADING|CONSTRUCTION|CONTRACTING|CONTRACTORS|BUILDERS|TRUCKING|HAULING|FARMS?|RANCH(?:ES)?|DAIRY|ORCHARDS?|NURSERY|LANDSCAPING|LAND[ \\t]CLEARING|LAND[ \\t]MANAGEMENT|PAVING|DEMOLITION|SITEWORK|UTILITIES|PIPELINE|ENTERPRISES|HOLDINGS|INDUSTRIES|SERVICES|(?:&|AND)[ \\t]SONS|BROTHERS|BROS\\.?)(?![A-Za-z])(?:,?[ \\t]{1,2}(?:L\\.?L\\.?C\\.?|INC\\.?|INCORPORATED|CO\\.|CORP\\.?|CORPORATION|COMPANY|LTD\\.?|LIMITED|L\\.?L\\.?P\\.?|PLLC|L\\.P\\.|LP)(?![A-Za-z]))?|[A-Za-z0-9&'’][A-Za-z0-9&'’.\\-]{0,25},?[ \\t]{1,2}(?:L\\.?L\\.?C\\.?|INC\\.?|INCORPORATED|CO\\.|CORP\\.?|CORPORATION|COMPANY|LTD\\.?|LIMITED|L\\.?L\\.?P\\.?|PLLC|L\\.P\\.|LP)(?![A-Za-z]))(?:,?[ \\t]{1,2}(?:YARD|SITE|LANDING|UNIT|LOT|DIVISION|DIV\\.?|BRANCH|SHOP|PLANT|CAMP|JOB)[ \\t]?#?[A-Za-z0-9\\-]{1,8}|[ \\t]{1,2}[\\-–][ \\t]{1,2}[A-Za-z0-9&'’][A-Za-z0-9&'’.\\-]{0,25}(?:[ \\t][A-Za-z0-9&'’][A-Za-z0-9&'’.\\-]{0,25}){0,3})?(?:[ \\t]{1,6}(?-i:[A-Z]{2,6}[0-9O]{1,4}))?(?=[ \\t]{0,6}$))|(?m-i:(?<![^\\n \\t])(?<=(?<![^\\n])[ \\t]{0,6})(?=(?=[A-Z0-9&'])[A-Z0-9&'.,/\\-]{1,30}(?:[ ]{1,3}[A-Z0-9&'.,/\\-]{1,30}){0,5}(?=[ \\t]{0,6}$))(?<=[SsBb](?<![A-Za-z][SsBb])(?i:OLD|HIP|ILL)[ \\t]{0,3}-?[ \\t]{0,3}(?i:TO)(?![A-Za-z])[^\\n]{0,50}\\n(?:(?![^\\n]{0,70}?(?i:SOLD[ \\t]BY|SHIP[ \\t]BY|SHIP[ \\t]VIA|DESCRIPTION|QTY|STOCK[ \\t]?#|P\\.?[ \\t]?O\\.?[ \\t]?(?:#|NO|NUMBER)|P/O|CUSTOMER[ \\t]PO|TERMS|INVOICE|UNIT[ \\t]SALE))[^\\n]{0,70}\\n){0,9}[ \\t]{0,6})(?=[A-Z0-9&'])[A-Z0-9&'.,/\\-]{1,30}(?:[ ]{1,3}[A-Z0-9&'.,/\\-]{1,30}){0,5}(?=[ \\t]{0,6}$))",
      "description": "Customer name and address on the same line as its label (Sold To:, Bill To:, Ship To:, Deliver To:, Customer:, Buyer:, Attn, Contact:, Site contact:, Print name:, Printed name:, Accepted by:, Received by:), stopping at the next label; a customer company alone on its line, as in the Sold To / Ship To block of a scan (a name ending in LLC, Inc., Co., Corp., Ltd. or in a trade word such as Logging, Timber, Excavating, Farms, Ranch, & Sons, with an optional Yard / Site / Landing and the customer code after it, as on a footer line); and in a PDF with text every line in capitals under a Sold To / Ship To label without colon (names, job site, customer code). SAME, WILL CALL, PICK UP and lines with Equipment, Tractor, Implement, Machinery, Sales, Supply, Rental, Bank or Finance stay visible, so the dealer's name is kept (the Loan pattern hides a lender on a payoff, lien or financing line).",
      "enabled": true
